the rest of you are working.

1344
00:45:27,233 --> 00:45:30,900
-While the cat's away,
the mouse will play.

1345
00:45:30,933 --> 00:45:31,633
-Doh.

1346
00:45:31,667 --> 00:45:33,033
-That island--

1347
00:45:33,067 --> 00:45:33,567
-I hate it.

1348
00:45:33,600 --> 00:45:35,700
It's taunting me.

1349
00:45:35,733 --> 00:45:37,400
-Vegetation certainly
looks different from that

1350
00:45:37,433 --> 00:45:39,000
around here.

1351
00:45:39,033 --> 00:45:41,033
